      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear what you're saying but it just feels so exhausting to keep holding on to things that are basically doomed. it's like being a passenger on a ship that's already hit the iceberg and we're just sitting here pretending the band should keep playing. sometimes i wonder if it would be more dignified to just step off the ship early rather than waiting for the water to take us. does it even make sense to stay for the inevitable?",
